{"src":"en","tgt":"ru","rate":24000,"room_opened_ms_before":1500,"err":"","clip_ms":164500,"events":[{"kind":"hello","type":"hello","lang":"ru","src":"en","rate":24000,"mode":"utterance","edition":"nonprofit","context":true},{"kind":"input","t":6136.474473,"text":"But after losing the captain's wicket, India only made 36 runs, losing seven was a big"},{"kind":"text","t":6541.242112,"text":"Но после потери викета капитана Индия набрала всего 36 ранов, и потеря семи стала большой"},{"kind":"audio","t":6696.208304999999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":60,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":6697.619733,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":6698.7871270000005,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":6700.358378,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":6702.4198289999995,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1340},{"kind":"audio","t":6702.751266,"samples":2507,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":12759.972414,"text":"They usually have special food, drink, and entertainment offers to keep guests in a good mood and to keep them at the premise."},{"kind":"text","t":13323.331402,"text":"Обычно у них есть специальные предложения по еде, напиткам и развлечениям, чтобы поддерживать хорошее настроение гостей и удерживать их на территории."},{"kind":"audio","t":13519.253757999999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":50,"off":1310},{"kind":"audio","t":13520.558824,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":13522.214637000001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":13523.882901,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":13525.505353,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":13527.128956,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":13528.765219,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":13528.921572,"samples":6352,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":10},{"kind":"input","t":19242.400024000002,"text":"Del Potro has the early advantage in the second set, but this is too required a tie break after"},{"kind":"text","t":19633.157444,"text":"Дель Потро ведет в начале второго сета, но в итоге потребовался тай-брейк."},{"kind":"audio","t":19730.934429,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":70,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":19732.47907,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":960},{"kind":"audio","t":19734.093852,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":150,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":19734.969220000003,"samples":19839,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":680},{"kind":"input","t":25303.430888000003,"text":"The internet combines elements of both mass and interpersonal communication."},{"kind":"text","t":25645.104532,"text":"Интернет сочетает в себе элементы как массовой, так и межличностной коммуникации."},{"kind":"audio","t":25759.206555,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":50,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":25760.787136000003,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":25762.384148,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":25764.091563,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":25764.345748,"samples":9083,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":220},{"kind":"input","t":34446.937838,"text":"The composition of these crystals matches those found in urine of affected pets when compared by infrared spectroscopy."},{"kind":"text","t":35005.429378,"text":"Состав этих кристаллов совпадает с составом кристаллов, обнаруженных в моче больных домашних животных, при сравнении методом инфракрасной спектроскопии."},{"kind":"audio","t":35196.649209999996,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":10,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":35197.879595,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1240},{"kind":"audio","t":35199.691901,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":290,"off":1060},{"kind":"audio","t":35203.275582999995,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":220,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":35206.348865,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1340},{"kind":"audio","t":35209.274093,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":420,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":35212.534608999995,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":20,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":35215.473137999994,"samples":30037,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1060},{"kind":"input","t":36885.328564999996,"text":"F-T-I-R."},{"kind":"text","t":37079.756800999996,"text":"ИК-фурье-спектроскопия."},{"kind":"audio","t":37123.233704,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":60,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":37123.476759,"samples":11814,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":360},{"kind":"input","t":42286.86403,"text":"on some routes the larger companies have their own planes but for other routes and smaller firms there was a"},{"kind":"text","t":42729.729246999996,"text":"на некоторых маршрутах у более крупных компаний есть собственные самолеты, но для других маршрутов и более мелких фирм существовал"},{"kind":"audio","t":42880.247920999995,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":30,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":42881.563207,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":42883.400603999995,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":42886.645499,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":42889.867104,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":42893.200451,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":42893.382695,"samples":3733,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":40},{"kind":"input","t":49516.412408,"text":"Some atoms have unstable nuclei, which means that they tend to break up"},{"kind":"text","t":49884.262537999995,"text":"У некоторых атомов нестабильные ядра, а это значит, что они склонны к распаду."},{"kind":"audio","t":49989.35495,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":50,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":49990.832309,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":990},{"kind":"audio","t":49992.388581,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":160,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":49994.048323999996,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":49994.164366,"samples":3510,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":53496.425165,"text":"and break apart with little or no nudging."},{"kind":"text","t":53691.960724,"text":"и распадаются практически без внешнего воздействия."},{"kind":"audio","t":53760.617872999996,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":40,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":53762.205245,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":10,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":53762.46677,"samples":10532,"rate":24000,"on":30,"off":230},{"kind":"input","t":60646.666771,"text":"The same month saw another airliner overrun a runway at Moshland and strike a wall killing 17."},{"kind":"text","t":61459.424509,"text":"В том же месяце еще один авиалайнер выкатился за пределы взлетно-посадочной полосы в Мошленде и врезался в стену, в результате чего погибли 17 человек."},{"kind":"audio","t":61660.001669,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":40,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":61661.462397999996,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":61663.095511,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":61664.734244,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":61666.309545,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":61667.889457,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1090},{"kind":"audio","t":61669.54244,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":270,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":61671.208144,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1310},{"kind":"audio","t":61671.308736,"samples":2284,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":67221.480777,"text":"They are almost all sandy beaches with safe swimming and most have shade provided by"},{"kind":"text","t":67693.415888,"text":"Почти все они представляют собой песчаные пляжи с безопасным купанием, и на большинстве из них есть тень от"},{"kind":"audio","t":67827.208646,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":40,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":67828.513882,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":67830.37697900001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":67831.699506,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":67833.37063,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":67833.56592400001,"samples":8359,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":210},{"kind":"input","t":70269.307887,"text":"Pohican trees."},{"kind":"text","t":70418.82278,"text":"деревьев похикан."},{"kind":"audio","t":70457.12887,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":40,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":70457.295973,"samples":5405,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":30},{"kind":"input","t":76415.90371,"text":"Popular sports include football, basketball, volleyball, water polo, fencing, rugby,"},{"kind":"text","t":76864.527352,"text":"Популярные виды спорта включают футбол, баскетбол, волейбол, водное поло, фехтование, регби,"},{"kind":"audio","t":77016.61603800001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":40,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":77017.984165,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":77019.570877,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":77021.21333,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":77022.92171400001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":77024.60666800001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1220},{"kind":"audio","t":77024.769042,"samples":1783,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":80705.350323,"text":"cycling, ice hockey, roller hockey, and F1."},{"kind":"text","t":81061.261543,"text":"велоспорт, хоккей с шайбой, хоккей с мячом и Формулу-1."},{"kind":"audio","t":81152.222161,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":50,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":81153.69256000001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":810},{"kind":"audio","t":81155.347313,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":20,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":81155.645309,"samples":10365,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":270},{"kind":"input","t":86524.132551,"text":"In the warm climate of the Middle East, the house was not so important."},{"kind":"text","t":86860.96034800001,"text":"В теплом климате Ближнего Востока дом был не так важен."},{"kind":"audio","t":86929.76611000001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":30,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":86931.06734600001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":86931.506335,"samples":13040,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":350},{"kind":"input","t":93191.847863,"text":"The lake lies 120 kilometers north of Peninsula."},{"kind":"text","t":93509.59138700001,"text":"Озеро находится в 120 километрах к северу от полуострова."},{"kind":"audio","t":93592.617905,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":60,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":93594.230157,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":93595.87294,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1250},{"kind":"audio","t":93595.98730200001,"samples":2563,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":98313.117908,"text":"The cabbage juice changes color depending on how acidic, basic, alkaline the chemical is."},{"kind":"text","t":98803.09285100001,"text":"Капустный сок меняет цвет в зависимости от того, насколько кислым, основным или щелочным является химическое вещество."},{"kind":"audio","t":98970.993065,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":20,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":98972.25057,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":98973.92725400001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":98975.54842600001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":98977.23994,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":98978.888823,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":98979.752981,"samples":19616,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":640},{"kind":"input","t":105745.89427,"text":"The bridge is scheduled to be fully operational in September 2017 when the Brazilian custom checkpoints are expected to be finished."},{"kind":"text","t":106401.242486,"text":"Ожидается, что мост будет полностью введен в эксплуатацию в сентябре 2017 года, когда будут завершены работы по созданию бразильских таможенных пунктов."},{"kind":"audio","t":106600.22236300001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":40,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":106601.50984900001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":106603.155132,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":106604.76504500001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":106606.36137700001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":106607.95878900001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1090},{"kind":"audio","t":106609.61918200001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":60,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":106611.25624500001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":106611.42703800001,"samples":7300,"rate":24000,"on":20,"off":190},{"kind":"input","t":113132.76197,"text":"The moisture on your hands will react with the outer layers, which will feel funny and form a sort of shell."},{"kind":"text","t":113709.916174,"text":"Влага на ваших руках вступит в реакцию с внешними слоями, что вызовет странное ощущение и приведет к образованию своего рода оболочки."},{"kind":"audio","t":113875.85451800001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":40,"off":1340},{"kind":"audio","t":113877.192415,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":30,"off":1340},{"kind":"audio","t":113878.819338,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":113880.50256200001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":113882.109414,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1340},{"kind":"audio","t":113883.718456,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":113884.90340000001,"samples":24910,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":790},{"kind":"input","t":119592.130896,"text":"One bomb exploded outside the Governor's General's office."},{"kind":"text","t":119887.18018400001,"text":"Одна бомба взорвалась перед офисом генерал-губернатора."},{"kind":"audio","t":119959.127379,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":30,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":119960.68126,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":119961.445456,"samples":18055,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":570},{"kind":"input","t":125311.936315,"text":"The Moroccan Sultan rebuilt the city as Daru i Bayt"},{"kind":"text","t":125632.45857500001,"text":"Марокканский султан перестроил город как Дару и Байт."},{"kind":"audio","t":125710.462652,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":50,"off":1230},{"kind":"audio","t":125711.779198,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":270,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":125713.26395800001,"samples":30594,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1180},{"kind":"input","t":130414.402702,"text":"and it was given the name Casablanca by Spanish traders who established trading bases."},{"kind":"text","t":130817.531631,"text":"и испанские торговцы, основавшие здесь торговые базы, дали ему название Касабланка."},{"kind":"audio","t":130944.39294,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":60,"off":1320},{"kind":"audio","t":130945.94131100002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":130947.582484,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":130949.23376700001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":130950.961402,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":130951.27646800001,"samples":10866,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":300},{"kind":"input","t":142851.61513199998,"text":"He was greeted by Singapore's Deputy Prime Minister Wong Kan-seng and discussed trade and terrorism issues with the Singapore Prime Minister Lee Hsien Long."},{"kind":"text","t":143651.75415599998,"text":"Его приветствовал заместитель премьер-министра Сингапура Вонг Кан Сенг, и он обсудил вопросы торговли и терроризма с премьер-министром Сингапура Ли Сянь Лунгом."},{"kind":"audio","t":143848.10522099998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":60,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":143849.43113799999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":143851.03242,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":143852.54556,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":143854.25683499998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1170},{"kind":"audio","t":143855.804056,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":180,"off":1070},{"kind":"audio","t":143857.52554,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":10,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":143859.147073,"samples":32544,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1180},{"kind":"input","t":154253.633775,"text":"The fission bomb works on the principle that it takes energy to put together a nucleus with many protons and neutrons."},{"kind":"text","t":154728.652618,"text":"Бомба деления работает по принципу, согласно которому для сборки ядра с большим количеством протонов и нейтронов требуется энергия."},{"kind":"audio","t":154892.488209,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":50,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":154893.980379,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":960},{"kind":"audio","t":154895.645833,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":20,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":154897.269365,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":154898.891128,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":980},{"kind":"audio","t":154900.561292,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":60,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":154902.069142,"samples":29925,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1060},{"kind":"input","t":162815.621403,"text":"In the archipelago and lakes you do not necessarily need a yacht"},{"kind":"text","t":163077.520604,"text":"В архипелаге и озерах яхта не обязательно нужна."},{"kind":"audio","t":163161.043502,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":40,"off":1060},{"kind":"audio","t":163162.29721699998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":250,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":163164.105104,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":163164.365319,"samples":6742,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":120},{"kind":"close","t":174603.215312,"code":1005}]}